        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Mat 11:10; Marko 1:2; Luka 1:76; 7:27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi asema, “Tazama, namtuma mjumbe wangu anitangulie kunitayarishia njia. Bwana mnayemtafuta atalijia hekalu lake ghafla. Mjumbe mnayemtazamia kwa hamu kubwa atakuja na kutangaza agano langu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
